pan class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是修正向量方向上的法线。每个邻居贡献一个这样的半平面，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的可行速度集是所有半平面的交——一个凸多边形。于是问题变成：<strong>在这个凸可行域里，找一个最接近偏好速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}^{pref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的速度</strong>。这正是一个二维线性规划，可用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 期望时间的随机增量算法逐条加入半平面求解（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为邻居数）。一帧之内对每个 agent 解一次，整体随 agent 数线性扩展。</p>\n<p>下表对比三者在工程上的实际表现差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>VO</th>\n<th>RVO</th>\n<th>ORCA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>振荡</td>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>消除</td>\n<td>消除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解方式</td>\n<td>锥外搜索</td>\n<td>锥外搜索（互惠约束）</td>\n<td>半平面线性规划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单 agent 复杂度</td>\n<td>与邻居数相关</td>\n<td>与邻居数相关</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（k=邻居数，期望）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程成熟度</td>\n<td>教学用</td>\n<td>较多</td>\n<td>引擎主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理静态障碍</td>\n<td>需扩展</td>\n<td>需扩展</td>\n<td>自然纳入（线段 VO）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"落地细节与失败模式\">落地细节与失败模式</h2><p>ORCA 漂亮，但直接照搬会踩坑，下面是实战里最常见的几处。<strong>时间窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：VO 通常只考虑未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 秒内的碰撞（截断 VO），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 太大 agent 会过度提前避让显得胆小，太小则反应不及险些相撞，需按 agent 速度调。<strong>线性规划不可行</strong>：在极度拥挤时，所有半平面的交可能为空（无论怎么走都&quot;会撞&quot;）。ORCA 的处理是退而求其次，做一次 3D 线性规划，找一个&quot;违反约束最少&quot;的速度——宁可轻微挤一下也别卡死。<strong>与全局寻路衔接</strong>：偏好速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}^{pref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须由上层寻路提供（指向路径上的下一个目标），ORCA 只管局部不撞，不管全局往哪走——这条解耦边界至关重要，全局路径来自 <a href=\"crowd-navmesh\">人群与导航网格</a>。<strong>静态障碍</strong>：墙和障碍可建模成&quot;速度为零的特殊邻居&quot;，贡献各自的半平面约束，与动态 agent 统一处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LP[解 ORCA 线性规划] --&gt; F{可行域非空?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| OK[取最接近偏好速度的解]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| D3[退化: 3D 线性规划&lt;br/&gt;最小化最大约束违反]&#10;    D3 --&gt; SOFT[选违反最少的速度&lt;br/&gt;允许轻微挤压]&#10;    OK --&gt; NEXT[推进一帧]&#10;    SOFT --&gt; NEXT\">graph TD\n    LP[解 ORCA 线性规划] --&gt; F{可行域非空?}\n    F --&gt;|是| OK[取最接近偏好速度的解]\n    F --&gt;|否| D3[退化: 3D 线性规划&lt;br/&gt;最小化最大约束违反]\n    D3 --&gt; SOFT[选违反最少的速度&lt;br/&gt;允许轻微挤压]\n    OK --&gt; NEXT[推进一帧]\n    SOFT --&gt; NEXT</pre><h2 id=\"与其它方法的关系\">与其它方法的关系</h2><p>要理解 ORCA 在整个 hub 里的位置：它替代的是 <a href=\"../foundations/boids-model\">Boids</a> 三规则里的&quot;分离&quot;和 <a href=\"../foundations/steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a> 里的 agent 间避让——那些方法用位置空间的排斥力，ORCA 用速度空间的硬约束，后者更精确、不抖动、规模更大。但 ORCA 不替代全局寻路，也不替代 <a href=\"../crowds/continuum-crowds\">连续介质人群</a> 的宏观流向——典型的工业架构是&quot;宏观流场/寻路定方向（给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}^{pref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）+ ORCA 做近距离精确避让&quot;。它也不直接处理拥堵密度问题，那需要叠加 <a href=\"../crowds/density-flow-control\">密度与流量控制</a> 的限流。值得一提的是，本 hub 的兄弟 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/local-avoidance-rvo\">寻路与导航网格</a> 也会从&quot;路径跟随的局部补丁&quot;角度简述 RVO，但本篇才是把它讲到线性规划层面的主讲处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>碰撞是速度的事，位置空间的排斥力会振荡卡死；速度障碍把&quot;会撞的速度&quot;建模成速度空间的锥形禁区。</li>\n<li>RVO 用&quot;双方各让一半&quot;的互惠假设消除了 VO 的来回振荡。</li>\n<li>ORCA 把每个邻居的避让约束化成半平面，可行速度是半平面的交，求最接近偏好速度的解即一个二维线性规划，随 agent 数线性扩展。</li>\n<li>实战要点：截断时间窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>、不可行时退化为 3D LP 允许轻微挤压、偏好速度由上层寻路给出、静态障碍当零速邻居。</li>\n<li>ORCA 替代的是 Boids/转向里的 agent 间避让，但不替代全局寻路与宏观流向，典型架构是&quot;流场定向+ORCA 避让&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章衔接：<a href=\"crowd-navmesh\">人群与导航网格</a>——偏好速度从哪来、与寻路如何拼接。</li>\n<li>上游来源：<a href=\"../foundations/steering-behaviors\">转向行为</a>——ORCA 取代的位置空间避让方法。</li>\n<li>跨库：从路径跟随角度看局部避障，见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/movement/local-avoidance-rvo\">寻路 · 局部避障 RVO</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RVO 与 ORCA 避障","id":"rvo-与-orca-避障"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从速度障碍到互惠","id":"从速度障碍到互惠"},{"level":2,"text":"ORCA：从锥形到半平面线性规划","id":"orca-从锥形到半平面线性规划"},{"level":2,"text":"落地细节与失败模式","id":"落地细节与失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它方法的关系","id":"与其它方法的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"密度与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/density-flow-control"},"next":{"title":"人群与导航网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/navigation/crowd-navmesh"}}